        {
          "type": "explain",
          "title": "Usage tips",
          "body": "- [[Obéir à]] takes à: [[obéir aux règles]].\n- [[Cesser de]] + infinitive = [[arrêter de]].\n- [[Il ne va pas tarder]] = he'll be here soon.\n- [[Mentir]] is irregular: [[je mens, il a menti]].\n- [[Puer]] is informal; [[sentir mauvais]] is neutral.\n- Québec: [[écœurer]] often means *to annoy, to pester* ([[Arrête de m'écœurer !]]); everywhere it also means *to disgust*."
        }
